                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>See Table 4 in Timothy Curry and Lynn Shibut. &ldquo;<a href="https://www.fdic.gov/bank/analytical/banking/2000dec/brv13n2_2.pdf">The Cost of the Savings and Loan Crisis: Truth and Consequences</a>,&rdquo; FDIC <em>Banking Review</em>, 2000, vol. 13, no. 2.</p></div>
