                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote13" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 13"><sup>13</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>For a discussion of moral hazard associated with discount window lending, see Huberto M. Ennis and David A. Price, &ldquo;<a href="/publications/research/economic_brief/2015/eb_15-05">Discount Window Lending: Policy Trade-offs and the 1985 BoNY Computer Failure</a>,&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond <em>Economic Brief</em> no. 15-05, May 2015.</p></div>
